# Code owners for rossoctl/cortex.
#
# Owners here are DERIVED from the project's source of truth for maintainership:
#   https://github.com/rossoctl/rossoctl/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md
#
# CODEOWNERS cannot reference that file, or any file: GitHub accepts only user and team
# handles, and it is read only from this repository's root, .github/ or docs/ -- there is no
# inheritance from rossoctl/rossoctl to lean on. So these names are a copy, and they have to
# be updated when MAINTAINERS.md changes.
#
# A rule naming a user or team that does not exist, or that lacks write access here, is
# ignored -- the matched paths end up with no owner. GitHub reports this only in the file
# view and via the API; after editing, `gh api repos/rossoctl/cortex/codeowners/errors`
# must return an empty list. That one call checks existence, visibility and write access
# for every handle in this file.

# Default owners for everything. The AuthBridge components used to carry their
# own rule for authbridge/; that tree is now the repo root, so `*` covers it.
* @rossoctl/maintainers

# CI/CD and GitHub configuration, owned per MAINTAINERS.md (Cortex proxy & plugin
